# This app is self-contained by default: the Next.js server that renders the
# frontend also serves POST /api/predict (the trained autoencoder runs inline,
# in-process, as a plain TypeScript module — no external ML service, database,
# or API key is required to run or deploy it).
#
# The variable below is only needed for the advanced case where the inference
# API is deployed separately from the frontend (see README.md > "ML Backend").
# Leave it unset for the default, single-deployment architecture.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://your-separately-hosted-api.example.com
